WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.778
The build was green.

2
00:00:01.778 --> 00:00:03.895
The crawlers saw a blank page.

3
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:10.787
Hundreds of pages were empty to crawlers while every build passed.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.702
An outside audit flagged it,

5
00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:18.564
and a thirty-second curl check showed zero characters in production.

6
00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:22.048
I made the prerender strict by default,

7
00:00:22.048 --> 00:00:26.019
and added a second check that counts the text on every page.

8
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:32.117
An empty page now stops the deploy, proved by breaking it on purpose.

